\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.6}{\ignorespaces  Cross section of the vacuum chamber and dual high NA objective sandwich. Lower right inset shows the vacuum chamber housed in the MuMetal enclosure, with dashed lines indicating the cross section region. Custom recessed CF-100 viewports are used to provide optical access for the high NA objectives (working distance $= 24.4~\unit {mm}$). }}{24}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:HNA}{{3.6}{24}{Cross section of the vacuum chamber and dual high NA objective sandwich. Lower right inset shows the vacuum chamber housed in the MuMetal enclosure, with dashed lines indicating the cross section region. Custom recessed CF-100 viewports are used to provide optical access for the high NA objectives (working distance $= 24.4~\unit {mm}$)}{figure.caption.7}{}}
