\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.7}{\ignorespaces Optical path for fluorescent imaging of the ions using both a CMOS camera and a Photon-multiplier tube. Insets on right hand side show typical signal for: spatial resolution of eight ions in a linear chain (top), time resolution of detected photons from the ion chain (bottom). }}{26}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:readout}{{3.7}{26}{Optical path for fluorescent imaging of the ions using both a CMOS camera and a Photon-multiplier tube. Insets on right hand side show typical signal for: spatial resolution of eight ions in a linear chain (top), time resolution of detected photons from the ion chain (bottom)}{figure.caption.8}{}}
